  "description": "A lightweight library that brings attribute-based dependency injection to .NET, eliminating the need for constructor injection boilerplate. Use [AutoInject] and [Injectable] attributes to simplify your dependency injection. Now includes AddInjectBaseClasses for automatic registration of InjectBase classes and their dependencies.",
