  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: Added AddInjectBaseClasses() method for automatic registration of classes that inherit from InjectBase and their [Injectable] dependencies. This eliminates the need to manually register dependencies for repository and service classes that use the InjectBase pattern.",
